## R8. The message's refusal (round 1's P6)

$ [terminal] handoff fyi - no merges tonight
handoff fyi: fyi takes no flags, and a message can't start with -: give the message alone, in quotes, such as handoff fyi "Carry on while I'm away."
# exit 2

$ [terminal] handoff fyi --as operator Carry on.
handoff fyi: fyi takes no flags, and a message can't start with -: give the message alone, in quotes, such as handoff fyi "Carry on while I'm away."
# exit 2
